                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Honestly the game just wasn't fun for me to go through, I went through it to finish the achievements as all the online ones now automatically unlock and after an genuine attempt to play as intended to earn the 1 hour as each character achievements I quickly gave up and found a way to AFK for the hour as each character achievements.\nPerhaps it was better back when online was around but single player was just not a great time. The controls didn't feel great on a controller and enemies were quick to hunt you down and attacking with different moves was confusing.\nAlso if you have steam VR installed it will launch it when the game launches despite not supporting VR.",
